row><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Explain how this\nturns a Cauchy prior into a Gibbs sampler with normal full conditionals\nin the probit model.</p>","file":"ch39-glms-in-practice-bayes/05-priors-as-regularizers.html"}